SUMMARY:Intermediate Ride (C) - LV Green Dragon (35H)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, an
 d Ride Together**\n\n**Ride leader: Rachel and Kirsten**\n**Ride sweep: TB
 D**\n\n**Anticipated Average Pace: (14-16 mph)**\n\n**[https://ridewithgps
 .com/routes/30713504](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/30713504)**\n\n**This
  is an Intermediate C Class ride. The ride leader will ride at the adverti
 sed average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule
  as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group 
 together with occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple groups
  to align to pace capabilities.**\n\n**Please do not join this ride if you
  are not willing to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, y
 ou will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group. If ma
 intaining a 14-16 mph average is beyond your current ability level\, pleas
 e consider joining a slower ride first.**\n\n**Helmets are mandatory. No e
 arbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire lever
 s\, pump/CO2 inflator).**\n\n**To eliminate passing around a pen and paper
  waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join thi
 s ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here** [
 Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&c
 lub_id=257148)\n\n**Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Cod
 e of Conduct:** [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/conten
 t.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\n**Guidance if an inc
 ident occurs:** [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.a
 spx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3167297
