SUMMARY:Casual D Ride: Brownstown CTC to Lapps Cafe and Creamery- 28 miles
  Rolling 12mph
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Starting at Brownstown 
 CTC\, follow the leader\, 14 rolling miles to Lapps Cafe and Creamery and 
 enjoy a treat and then return to the starting point another 14 miles for a
  total of 28 miles. Ride leader will travel at approximately 12 mph with n
 obody left behind.**\n\n**No cue sheet this is a follow the leader Ride**\
 n\n[https://ridewithgps.com/routes/57644987](https://ridewithgps.com/route
 s/57644987)\n\n**Ride Leader: Ann Morris**\n**Sweep: Joanie Nolin**\n\n***
 Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together***\n\n**Helmets are mandatory. No e
 arbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire lever
 s\, pump/CO2 inflator) and money for ice cream.**\n\n**Your RSVP is your a
 greement to abide by the club'** [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbi
 keclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) **and*
 * [Rules of the Road](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_
 id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\n**Guidance if an incident occurs:*
 * [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22
 &club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3170610
