SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU - CV Conestoga Cruisin’ (50F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: CP Weaver\n\
 n**Come celebrate CP's 51st birthday!**\n\n14-16 mph pace with multiple re
 group points to make sure no one gets dropped. Will also designate a sweep
  at the start.\n\n**Afterwards at 3 pm** all are welcome to our home for a
  get together where food and drink will be provided. **We will do beef and
  chicken taco bar.** No one is obligated to bring anything but feel free t
 o if you would like. Address will be provided at the start of the ride. We
  are 8 minutes off of the Adamstown exit of 222.\n\nCue and Ride with GPS 
 links:\n[https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-conestoga-cruisin-50f
 /](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-conestoga-cruisin-50f/)\n\n
 Helmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and 
 a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing 
 a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club member. Use this link to join
  the club.\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&clu
 b_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&clu
 b_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of C
 onduct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_
 id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.a
 spx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nand Rules of the Road\n[h
 ttps://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?](https://lancbikeclub.cl
 ubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3165801
