SUMMARY:See the leaves change on the Greenbelt Trail Ride 24 Flat RSVP Req
 uired
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSee the leaves change on 
 the Greenbelt trail in the woods as the among the beautiful fall color lea
 ves.....\nThe Harrisburg Greenbelt trail 24 miles at a casual pace. [https
 ://www.alltrails.com/trail/us/pennsylvania/harrisburg-capital-area-greenbe
 lt-trail](https://www.alltrails.com/trail/us/pennsylvania/harrisburg-capit
 al-area-greenbelt-trail)\nWe will ride from the Fort Hunter parking lot\, 
 5300 N. Front St\, at 2pm and do the loop around Harrisburg. This is a cas
 ual ride. Do not come on this ride if you do not agree to ride at a casual
  pace and stay with the group. Stopping for pictures and stopping at times
  to make sure no one left behind.\nAfter the ride\, those who want good fo
 od\, and hanging out together at the famous Front Street Diner 4003 Front 
 Street.\nHybrid or gravel bike recommended. Like always helmets are requir
 ed and carry a tube with you to fix a flat.\n\nTo eliminate passing around
  a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP b
 elow to join this ride.\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club memb
 er.\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's:\nJoin the Club\nC
 ode of Conduct\nRules of the Road\nRide Waiver\nIts a flexible fun ride\, 
 you are free to be\, just be cool and make great memories and add to prepa
 re for the future events like this one. \\*peace\nCOVID-19 safety measures
 \nEvent will be outdoor\n\nRichard Conner\, leader\n717-572-8480
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3163016
 24/
